<p>The code samples described on this page are also available on GitHub. Wi=
th a free GitHub account, you can:</p>
<ul>
<li>Keep a local repository (or 'repo') of the samples and sync whenever yo=
u see that updates have been made.</li>
<li>Subscribe to the repo get notified of updates or you can check the repo=
 for updates at your convenience.</li>
<li>Subscribe to activity at the issue level.</li>
<li>Suggest changes via pull requests and the <!-- -->ArcGIS Maps SDK for Q=
t<!-- --> team will merge the changes they like after a full review and tes=
ting phase.</li>
</ul>
<p>You can download each sample as an individual <a href=3D"https://links.e=
